<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54093" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατακᾰλύπτω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cover up</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατά τε κνίσῃ
				ἐκάλυψαν</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηρούς</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.460
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.47
			</span></i> (tm.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">με τεθνηῶτα . . κατὰ γαῖα καλύπτοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					6.464
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ δὲ σκότος ὄσσε κάλυψεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					16.325
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἴδην δὲ κατὰ νεφέεσσι
			κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				17.594
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κἀμὲ θανάτου κατὰ μοῖρα καλύψαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					917
				</span></i>
			 (anap.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				121
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				1315
			</span></i> (lyr.), etc.:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ κρᾶτα καλυψάμενος
				γοάασκεν</span>
			<i>having covered his</i> head, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				8.92
			</span></i>; so <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-καλυψάμενος</span> alone,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.67
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κἂν κατακεκαλυμμένος τις
			γνοίη</span> even one <i>veiled</i> would perceive, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Men.</u>
				76b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λογισμῷ κατακαλυψάμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					340a
				</span></i>
			.</div>
